  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agriculture &amp; Rural Development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT IS A PROGRAM TYPE OPERATION.  IT WOULD SUPPORT REDUCTION OF RURAL POVERTY BY ENHANCING AGRICULTURAL GROWTH, STIMULATING EMPLOYMENT-GENERATING NON-FARM ACTIVITIES, STRENGTHENING RURAL INSTITUTIONS INCLUDING LOCAL GOVERNMENT, AND IMPROVING EFFICIENCY OF PUBLIC ACTIONS TO BETTER SAVE THE INTERESTS OF THE RURAL POPULATION.  INDICATIVE PROJECT COMPONENTS ARE: (1) POLICY REFORMS (2) PUBLIC INVESTMENTS (3) PRIVATE SECTOR DEVELOPMENT AND (4) STRENGTHENING OF RURAL INSTITUTIONS INCLUDING LOCAL GOVERNMENT.</narrative>
  </description>
